  {
    "id": "TR01",
    "title": "贸易单价与银币",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "statement": "买价V*1.4*type*join*(1+loss)*(1-g-s)，卖价V*.6*type*SellPriceFactor*human*(1-loss)*(1+g+s+drug+animal)。分别max .5/.01，严格>99.5才Round，最后sell=min(sell,buy)。Silver绕过公式，双方价格恒MarketValue=1。RoyalFavor使用另一货币分支，未纳入项目。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "economy",
        "type": "RimWorld.TradeUtility",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 330,
        "range_sha256": "de12a556209ea51bb8f5a9196c0a2172d30c44a2022f3e11bbebba9c7ce19256"
      },
      {
