    "title": "商人缺银需显式确认",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "statement": "Dialog_Trade在DoesTraderHaveEnoughSilver失败时显示ConfirmTraderShortFunds，玩家确认才执行。LimitCurrencyCountToFunds仅截断双方可支付银币，不减少已选择商品、不产生债务。项目必须让少收金额可见，禁止静默确认。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "trade",
        "type": "RimWorld.Dialog_Trade",
